<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Help — Med Supply Innovation</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>
  <main class="container main-content">
    <section class="help-hero">
      <h1 class="help-title">Help</h1>
      <p class="help-subtitle">Find answers and guidance for using the Med Supply Innovation document portal.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="help-grid">
      <article class="help-card">
        <div class="help-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4"/><path d="M12 8h.01"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="help-card-title">Getting Started</h2>
        <p>Accounts are created by your organization (not self-registration). After your first sign-in you will set a permanent password, complete your profile, and turn on two-factor authentication. Then use the <strong>Dashboard</strong>, <strong>Upload Document</strong>, and <strong>My Documents</strong> (or <strong>Company documents</strong> if you are a client administrator).</p>
      </article>

      <article class="help-card">
        <div class="help-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="17 8 12 3 7 8"/><line x1="12" y1="3" x2="12" y2="15"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="help-card-title">Uploading Documents</h2>
        <p>Go to Upload Document and follow the steps: choose document type, upload the file, and add details (title, tag, description). Supported formats include PDF, Word (.doc, .docx), images, and CSV.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="help-card">
        <div class="help-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="help-card-title">Document Types &amp; Tags</h2>
        <p>Select the appropriate document type (e.g. Invoice, Contract, Certificate) and tag (e.g. Financial, Compliance, Other) when uploading. Use the checklist (&quot;?&quot; icon) for guidance on required documents.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="help-card">
        <div class="help-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="help-card-title">Security &amp; 2FA</h2>
        <p>Staff and client administrators must use two-factor authentication after completing their profile. Open <strong>Edit Profile</strong> (pencil on your dashboard card) and use the <strong>2FA</strong> button, or go to the two-factor settings page when the system prompts you.</p>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
